// Interrupt state — the declared contexts.
//
// `ints_off` is the SR save/mask/restore bracket (`move.w sr,-(sp)` /
// `move.w #$2700,sr` … `move.w (sp)+,sr`) as an ACQUIRED context: the compiler
// splices both halves and PROVES every path through the body reaches the
// restore. A caller that exposes SR in its contract declares `preserves(sr)` —
// the save/restore is the enforcement, and the spliced pair satisfies the
// balance check on its own — and owns the WHY comment at the bracket: atomicity
// rationales are site facts, not context facts. Every consumer in the tree
// declares it, so the clause reads as the contract and never as a lint's
// pressure: `[proc.sr-undeclared]` does NOT charge a consumer for the SR traffic
// this context splices in, because that traffic is declared HERE.
//
// `vblank` is a GRANTED context: the VBlank window cannot be acquired, only
// entered by the hardware. `grants(vblank)` on an interrupt entry point is a
// TRUST ROOT — the assembler cannot verify hardware dispatch, so the assertion
// is greppable and auditable rather than proven. What IS proven is the other
// side: a proc declaring `requires(vblank)` may only be called from inside the
// window (`[context.unsatisfied]`), so a VBlank-only routine can no longer be
// reached from the main loop by accident.
//
// Sites that stay HAND-SPELLED by design (a bracket is one lexical region with
// one entry and one exit): multi-exit brackets (one save, several
// restore-and-return paths — the DMA-queue transfer core); loops that re-mask
// under a single save (Sound_Init's alive-wait); and long spans whose masked
// region is a whole code block with its own internal structure
// (Section_RedrawPlanes, BG_Init, Sound_DrainSfxRing). STRUCTURAL exclusion: any
// bracket with a CCR out-contract can NEVER adopt — the full-SR restore
// overwrites CCR, so those sites pin their carry AFTER the restore (the
// DMA-queue core's andi/ori-to-ccr ordering). A hand-spelled site whose CCR does
// not round-trip declares the SR HALVES instead of the bare token:
// `preserves(sr.mask)` beside its flag result (the DMA-queue core) or beside
// `clobbers(sr.ccr)` (Sound_DrainSfxRing's empty fast path) — the partition
// check then reads the split the prose used to carry alone.
//
// Consumers `use engine.irq.{ints_off}` / `use engine.irq.{vblank}`.
//
// Pure comptime module: opens no section and emits ZERO bytes anywhere in the
// ROM — bytes appear only where a consumer brackets with it.
module engine.irq

pub context ints_off {
    acquire = asm {
        move.w  sr, -(sp)
        move.w  #$2700, sr
    }
    release = asm {
        move.w  (sp)+, sr
    }
}

pub context vblank { granted }
